+// Screen rotation for a unit that is upside down: 180 flips the panel (mirror x and y), 0 puts it back.
+// A 180 only lasts display_rotation_lease_ms (the host asks again every minute), and the IMU task calls
+// display_rotation_tick, so a screen can never stay flipped if the host goes away.
+void display_set_rotation(int degrees);
+void display_rotation_tick();
 
